summary:
10% System Sales Growth Excluding Russia Impact;

Led by 5% Same-Store Sales Growth with 979 Gross Unit Openings

LOUISVILLE, Ky., November 02, 2022--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Yum! Brands, Inc. (NYSE: YUM) today reported results for the third quarter ended September 30, 2022. Worldwide system sales excluding foreign currency translation grew 7%, with 5% same-store sales growth and 4% unit growth. Third quarter GAAP operating profit grew 4%. Third quarter core operating profit grew 8% including a 3-point
